# Pavan's Workflow — managed file manifest.
#
# The single list of what the framework installs into a project. install.sh,
# workflow_update.sh, workflow_doctor.sh, and CI all read this file through
# AI_Workflow_Kit/script/workflow_framework.py.
#
# kind    path
#
# tree    Framework-owned directory. Every file is installed/replaced. On update,
#         files that a previous release installed (AI_Workflow_Kit/installed.manifest)
#         and that no longer exist upstream are removed when unmodified. Files a
#         project added itself are never touched.
# file    Framework-owned file, replaced on update.
# seed    Copied only when missing; the project may customise it afterwards.
# state   Project-owned durable memory. Rendered from AI_Workflow_Kit/templates/
#         only when missing; never overwritten, never shipped from a used checkout.
# config  .omp/config.yml: merged and repaired by workflow_config_repair.py.

tree    .omp/agents
tree    .omp/commands
tree    .omp/extensions
tree    .omp/lib
tree    .omp/tests
file    .omp/AGENTS.md
file    .omp/workflow-context-policy.json
config  .omp/config.yml

tree    grilling
tree    ponytail
tree    ponytail-review
tree    ponytail-audit
tree    ponytail-debt
tree    ui-designer

tree    AI_Workflow_Kit/script
tree    AI_Workflow_Kit/vendor
tree    AI_Workflow_Kit/templates
tree    AI_Workflow_Kit/docs/AI
file    AI_Workflow_Kit/VERSION
file    AI_Workflow_Kit/framework.manifest

file    PIPELINE.md
file    ORCHESTRATOR_FIRST_PROMPT.md
seed    .graphifyignore

state   AI_Workflow_Kit/docs/PROJECT_CONTEXT.md
state   AI_Workflow_Kit/docs/STEPS.md
state   AI_Workflow_Kit/docs/DECISIONS.md
state   AI_Workflow_Kit/docs/AI/STATE.yaml
state   AI_Workflow_Kit/docs/AI/FEEDBACK.md
state   AI_Workflow_Kit/docs/AI/REPORT.md
state   AI_Workflow_Kit/docs/AI/BUG_REPORT.md
state   AI_Workflow_Kit/docs/AI/SECURITY_REPORT.md
state   AI_Workflow_Kit/docs/AI/COVERAGE.md
